WEBVTT

00:02:27.204 --> 00:02:30.454
which is involved
in all complex cognitive functions.

00:02:30.496 --> 00:02:33.913
Prefrontal cortex neurons are connected
to the posterior cortex

00:02:33.954 --> 00:02:37.829
by long, spindly cell extensions
called “neural fibers”.

00:02:38.246 --> 00:02:41.621
So this theory proposes that,
like a puppeteer pulling the strings,

00:02:41.663 --> 00:02:44.704
the prefrontal cortex neurons
send electrical signals

00:02:44.746 --> 00:02:46.538
down these neural fibers

00:02:46.579 --> 00:02:51.496
to multiple ensembles
in the posterior cortex.

00:02:51.996 --> 00:02:54.871
This activates them in unison.

00:02:54.913 --> 00:02:57.954
If the neuronal ensembles
are turned on at the same time,

00:02:57.996 --> 00:03:02.538
you experience the composite image
just as if you'd actually seen it.